ce','/fɔːr ˈɪnstəns/','例如','举例短语','[]',0,NULL,7909,'2026-09-01 11:48:08.436','2026-09-01 11:48:08.436'),(7910,57,'短语 adv. phr.','in addition','/ɪn əˈdɪʃən/','此外','递进短语','[]',0,NULL,7910,'2026-09-01 11:48:08.436','2026-09-01 11:48:08.436'),(7911,57,'短语 adv. phr.','as a result','/æz ə rɪˈzʌlt/','结果；因此','结果短语','[]',0,NULL,7911,'2026-09-01 11:48:08.436','2026-09-01 11:48:08.436'),(7912,57,'连接副词 adv.','consequently','/ˈkɑːnsəkwentli/','因此；结果','形容词 consequent','[]',0,NULL,7912,'2026-09-01 11:48:08.436','2026-09-01 11:48:08.436'),(7913,57,'连接副词 adv.','accordingly','/əˈkɔːrdɪŋli/','因此；相应地','动词 accord','[]',0,NULL,7913,'2026-09-01 11:48:08.436','2026-09-01 11:48:08.436'),(7914,57,'连接副词 adv.','similarly','/ˈsɪmələrli/','类似地','形容词 similar','[]',0,NULL,7914,'2026-09-01 11:48:08.436','2026-09-01 11:48:08.436'),(7915,57,'连接副词 adv.','likewise','/ˈlaɪkwaɪz/','同样地','副词 likewise','[]',0,NULL,7915,'2026-09-01 11:48:08.436','2026-09-01 11:48:08.436'),(7916,57,'短语 adv. phr.','in contrast','/ɪn ˈkɑːntræst/','相比之下','动词 contrast','[]',0,NULL,7916,'2026-09-01 11:48:08.436','2026-09-01 11:48:08.436'),(7917,57,'短语 adv. phr.','on the contrary','/ɑːn ðə ˈkɑːntreri/','相反','对比短语','[]',0,NULL,7917,'2026-09-01 11:48:08.436','2026-09-01 11:48:08.436'),(7918,57,'短语 adv. phr.','on the other hand','/ɑːn ði ˈʌðər hænd/','另一方面','对比短语','[]',0,NULL,7918,'2026-09-01 11:48:08.436','2026-09-01 11:48:08.436'),(7919,57,'短语 adv. phr.','in other words','/ɪn ˈʌðər wɝːdz/','换句话说','解释短语','[]',0,NULL,7919,'2026-09-01 11:48:08.436','2026-09-01 11:48:08.436'),(7920,57,'短语 adv. phr.','that is','/ðæt ɪz/','也就是说','解释短语；缩写 i.e.','[]',0,NULL,7920,'2026-09-01 11:48:08.436','2026-09-01 11:48:08.436'),(7921,57,'副词 adv.','namely','/ˈneɪmli/','即；也就是','解释副词','[]',0,NULL,7921,'2026-09-01 11:48:08.436','2026-09-01 11:48:08.436'),(7922,57,'短语 adv. phr.','above all','/əˈbʌv ɔːl/','最重要的是','强调短语','[]',0,NULL,7922,'2026-09-01 11:48:08.436','2026-09-01 11:48:08.436'),(7923,57,'短语 adv. phr.','after all','/ˈæftər ɔːl/','毕竟；终究','补充解释短语','[]',0,NULL,7923,'2026-09-01 11:48:08.436','2026-09-01 11:48:08.436'),(7924,57,'短语 adv. phr.','all in all','/ɔːl ɪn ɔːl/','总的来说','总结短语','[]',0,NULL,7924,'2026-09-01 11:48:08.436','2026-09-01 11:48:08.436'),(7925,57,'短语 adv. phr.','in conclusion','/ɪn kənˈkluːʒən/','总之；最后','总结短语','[]',0,NULL,7925,'2026-09-01 11:48:08.436','2026-09-01 11:48:08.436'),(7926,58,'句型 pattern','It is + adj. + to do','/ɪt ɪz ... tə duː/','做某事是……的','It is important to review.','[]',0,NULL,7926,'2026-09-01 11:48:08.439','2026-09-01 11:48:08.439'),(7927,58,'句型 pattern','It is + adj. + that-clause','/ɪt ɪz ... ðæt/','……是……的','It is clear that...','[]',0,NULL,7927,'2026-09-01 11:48:08.439','2026-09-01 11:48:08.439'),(7928,58,'句型 pattern','It seems that...','/ɪt siːmz ðæt/','似乎……','seem 可换 appears','[]',0,NULL,7928,'2026-09-01 11:48:08.439','2026-09-01 11:48:08.439'),(7929,58,'句型 pattern','It appears that...','/ɪt əˈpɪrz ðæt/','看来……','正式表达','[]',0,NULL,7929,'2026-09-01 11:48:08.439','2026-09-01 11:48:08.439'),(7930,58,'句型 pattern','It turns out that...','/ɪt tɝːnz aʊt ðæt/','结果证明……','turns 可随时态变化','[]',0,NULL,7930,'2026-09-01 11:48:08.439','2026-09-01 11:48:08.439'),(7931,58,'句型 pattern','It follows that...','/ɪt ˈfɑːloʊz ðæt/','由此可见……','逻辑推论句型','[]',0,NULL,7931,'2026-09-01 11:48:08.439','2026-09-01 11:48:08.439'),(7932,58,'句型 pattern','It is likely that...','/ɪt ɪz ˈlaɪkli ðæt/','很可能……','反义 unlikely','[]',0,NULL,7932,'2026-09-01 11:48:08.439','2026-09-01 11:48:08.439'),(7933,58,'句型 pattern','It is possible that...','/ɪt ɪz ˈpɑːsəbəl ðæt/','有可能……','名词 possibility','[]',0,NULL,7933,'2026-09-01 11:48:08.439','2026-09-01 11:48:08.439'),(7934,58,'句型 pattern','It is necessary to do','/ɪt ɪz ˈnesəseri tə duː/','有必要做某事','形容词 necessary','[]',0,NULL,7934,'2026-09-01 11:48:08.439','2026-09-01 11:48:08.439'),(7935,58,'句型 pattern','It is difficult to do','/ɪt ɪz ˈdɪfɪkəlt tə duː/','做某事很困难','名词 difficulty','[]',0,NULL,7935,'2026-09-01 11:48:08.439','2026-09-01 11:48:08.439'),(7936,58,'句型 pattern','It is worth doing','/ɪt ɪz wɝːθ ˈduːɪŋ/','某事值得做','worth 后接动名词','[]',0,NULL,7936,'2026-09-01 11:48:08.439','2026-09-01 11:48:08.439'),(7937,58,'句型 pattern','It is no use doing','/ɪt ɪz noʊ juːs ˈduːɪŋ/','做某事没有用','近义 no good doing','[]',0,NULL,7937,'2026-09-01 11:48:08.439','2026-09-01 11:48:08.439'),(7938,58,'句型 pattern','It is time to do','/ɪt ɪz taɪm tə duː/','该做某事了','可用 high time','[]',0,NULL,7938,'2026-09-01 11:48:08.439','2026-09-01 11:48:08.439'),(7939,58,'句型 pattern','It is time that...','/ɪt ɪz taɪm ðæt/','是……的时候了','从句常用过去式','[]',0,NULL,7939,'2026-09-01 11:48:08.439','2026-09-01 11:48:08.439'),(7940,58,'句型 pattern','It takes + time + to do','/ɪt teɪks ... tə duː/','做某事花费……时间','take 随时态变化','[]',0,NULL,7940,'2026-09-01 11:48:08.439','2026-09-01 11:48:08.439'),(7941,58,'句型 pattern','It costs + money + to do','/ɪt kɔːsts ... tə duː/','做某事花费……钱','cost 不规则 cost-cost-cost','[]',0,NULL,7941,'2026-09-01 11:48:08.439','2026-09-01 11:48:08.439'),(7942,58,'句型 pattern','There is + singular noun','/ðer ɪz/','有一个……','复数 there are','[]',0,NULL,7942,'2026-09-01 11:48:08.439','2026-09-01 11:48:08.439'),(7943,58,'句型 pattern','There are + plural noun','/ðer ɑːr/','有若干……','单数 there is','[]',0,NULL,7943,'2026-09-01 11:48:08.439','2026-09-01 11:48:08.439'),(7944,58,'句型 pattern','There seems to be...','/ðer siːmz tə bi/','似乎有……','seems 可换 appears','[]',0,NULL,7944,'2026-09-01 11:48:08.439','2026-09-01 11:48:08.439'),(7945,58,'句型 pattern','There is no doubt that...','/ðer ɪz noʊ daʊt ðæt/','毫无疑问……','doubt 名词/动词','[]',0,NULL,7945,'2026-09-01 11:48:08.439','2026-09-01 11:48:08.439'),(7946,58,'句型 pattern','There is no need to do','/ðer ɪz noʊ niːd tə duː/','没有必要做某事','need 名词/动词','[]',0,NULL,7946,'2026-09-01 11:48:08.439','2026-09-01 11:48:08.439'),(7947,58,'句型 pattern','There is a chance that...','/ðer ɪz ə tʃæns ðæt/','有可能……','chance 可复数 chances','[]',0,NULL,7947,'2026-09-01 11:48:08.439','2026-09-01 11:48:08.439'),(7948,58,'句型 pattern','There is a tendency to do','/ðer ɪz ə ˈtendənsi tə duː/','有……的趋