tern','The data show that...','/ðə ˈdeɪtə ʃoʊ ðæt/','数据显示……','data 可视作复数/不可数','[]',0,NULL,7960,'2026-09-01 11:48:08.439','2026-09-01 11:48:08.439'),(7961,58,'句型 pattern','The chart shows that...','/ðə tʃɑːrt ʃoʊz ðæt/','图表显示……','show 可换 indicate','[]',0,NULL,7961,'2026-09-01 11:48:08.439','2026-09-01 11:48:08.439'),(7962,58,'句型 pattern','The study found that...','/ðə ˈstʌdi faʊnd ðæt/','研究发现……','find-found-found','[]',0,NULL,7962,'2026-09-01 11:48:08.439','2026-09-01 11:48:08.439'),(7963,58,'句型 pattern','The survey indicates that...','/ðə ˈsɝːveɪ ˈɪndɪkeɪts ðæt/','调查表明……','indicate 动词','[]',0,NULL,7963,'2026-09-01 11:48:08.439','2026-09-01 11:48:08.439'),(7964,58,'句型 pattern','The evidence supports the idea that...','/ði ˈevɪdəns səˈpɔːrts ði aɪˈdiːə ðæt/','证据支持……观点','support 可作名词','[]',0,NULL,7964,'2026-09-01 11:48:08.439','2026-09-01 11:48:08.439'),(7965,58,'句型 pattern','This means that...','/ðɪs miːnz ðæt/','这意味着……','mean-meant-meant','[]',0,NULL,7965,'2026-09-01 11:48:08.439','2026-09-01 11:48:08.439'),(7966,58,'句型 pattern','This suggests that...','/ðɪs səˈdʒests ðæt/','这表明……','suggestion 名词','[]',0,NULL,7966,'2026-09-01 11:48:08.439','2026-09-01 11:48:08.439'),(7967,58,'句型 pattern','This indicates that...','/ðɪs ˈɪndɪkeɪts ðæt/','这说明……','indication 名词','[]',0,NULL,7967,'2026-09-01 11:48:08.439','2026-09-01 11:48:08.439'),(7968,58,'句型 pattern','This shows that...','/ðɪs ʃoʊz ðæt/','这显示……','showed/shown','[]',0,NULL,7968,'2026-09-01 11:48:08.439','2026-09-01 11:48:08.439'),(7969,58,'句型 pattern','This proves that...','/ðɪs pruːvz ðæt/','这证明……','proof 名词','[]',0,NULL,7969,'2026-09-01 11:48:08.439','2026-09-01 11:48:08.439'),(7970,58,'句型 pattern','This explains why...','/ðɪs ɪkˈspleɪnz waɪ/','这解释了为什么……','explanation 名词','[]',0,NULL,7970,'2026-09-01 11:48:08.439','2026-09-01 11:48:08.439'),(7971,58,'句型 pattern','This leads to...','/ðɪs liːdz tə/','这导致……','lead-led-led','[]',0,NULL,7971,'2026-09-01 11:48:08.439','2026-09-01 11:48:08.439'),(7972,58,'句型 pattern','This results in...','/ðɪs rɪˈzʌlts ɪn/','这造成……','result in + 结果','[]',0,NULL,7972,'2026-09-01 11:48:08.439','2026-09-01 11:48:08.439'),(7973,58,'句型 pattern','This is caused by...','/ðɪs ɪz kɔːzd baɪ/','这是由……造成的','被动结构','[]',0,NULL,7973,'2026-09-01 11:48:08.439','2026-09-01 11:48:08.439'),(7974,58,'句型 pattern','This is due to...','/ðɪs ɪz duː tə/','这是由于……','due to + 名词','[]',0,NULL,7974,'2026-09-01 11:48:08.439','2026-09-01 11:48:08.439'),(7975,58,'句型 pattern','This is because...','/ðɪs ɪz bɪˈkɔːz/','这是因为……','because 接从句','[]',0,NULL,7975,'2026-09-01 11:48:08.439','2026-09-01 11:48:08.439'),(7976,58,'句型 pattern','This is why...','/ðɪs ɪz waɪ/','这就是为什么……','why 接结果解释','[]',0,NULL,7976,'2026-09-01 11:48:08.439','2026-09-01 11:48:08.439'),(7977,58,'句型 pattern','One reason is that...','/wʌn ˈriːzən ɪz ðæt/','一个原因是……','reason 可复数','[]',0,NULL,7977,'2026-09-01 11:48:08.439','2026-09-01 11:48:08.439'),(7978,58,'句型 pattern','Another reason is that...','/əˈnʌðər ˈriːzən ɪz ðæt/','另一个原因是……','another + 单数','[]',0,NULL,7978,'2026-09-01 11:48:08.439','2026-09-01 11:48:08.439'),(7979,58,'句型 pattern','A major factor is...','/ə ˈmeɪdʒər ˈfæktər ɪz/','一个主要因素是……','factor 可复数','[]',0,NULL,7979,'2026-09-01 11:48:08.439','2026-09-01 11:48:08.439'),(7980,58,'句型 pattern','A key issue is...','/ə kiː ˈɪʃuː ɪz/','一个关键问题是……','issue 可复数','[]',0,NULL,7980,'2026-09-01 11:48:08.439','2026-09-01 11:48:08.439'),(7981,58,'句型 pattern','A possible solution is...','/ə ˈpɑːsəbəl səˈluːʃən ɪz/','一个可能的解决办法是……','solution to + 问题','[]',0,NULL,7981,'2026-09-01 11:48:08.439','2026-09-01 11:48:08.439'),(7982,58,'句型 pattern','A better approach is to do','/ə ˈbetər əˈproʊtʃ ɪz tə duː/','更好的方法是做……','approach to doing','[]',0,NULL,7982,'2026-09-01 11:48:08.439','2026-09-01 11:48:08.439'),(7983,58,'句型 pattern','The best way to do is to do','/ðə best weɪ tə duː ɪz tə duː/','做某事最好的方式是……','way to do/of doing','[]',0,NULL,7983,'2026-09-01 11:48:08.439','2026-09-01 11:48:08.439'),(7984,58,'句型 pattern','One way to solve this is 